0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"4E6kHJ7yxDpu43L8he6F7A","review_id":"rmEvg8OF9z3nF2BVklDqSg","date":"2018-04-11T06:25:50","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9503128528594971,"text_excerpt":"I'd heard of this place time and time again but what finally reeled me in was the happy hour! $2.50 tacos and $4-$5 drinks are a really great steal. The tacos aren't extremely gourmet, kinda greasy but overall yummy. My favorite was the brisket. Service was pretty good and attentive. The music was so on point, very hipster. The neighborhood is a nice walkable area with big trees. I loved the outside porch seating as well. Really cool place to swing by on a Friday evening. The place was jam packed in no time. Also GET THE CHURROS. You won't regret it!"},{"business_id":"4E6kHJ7yxDpu43L8he6F7A","review_id":"d2GPfl5rzjBqSRRvqChrYQ","date":"2018-05-22T22:19:03","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9407618045806885,"text_excerpt":"My boyfriend and I were visiting New Orleans, and my sister recommended La Casita for their awesome happy hour specials. I have to say that it was well worth the visit! Their happy hour prices are unbeatable. The porch was a gorgeous spot to sit, and it was a nice refuge from the intense midday heat. I ordered their $4 margarita, which came in a short glass rimmed with salt and a lime wedge, and it was STRONG. It wasn't even strong in terms of happy hour, it was just strong in general (which is a good thing). My boyfriend opted for two Michelob Ultras for a total of $5. We had a dinner planned for later, so we went with just one taco each to hold us over until then. I chose chicken, while..."},{"business_id":"4E6kHJ7yxDpu43L8he6F7A","review_id":"qiZ-IZpehC1s6x2N-RVZmA","date":"2018-01-20T15:06:56","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9337048530578613,"text_excerpt":"This place is the spot between 3 to 7pm...the tacos are great especially the happy hour prices!!!I enjoy this spot when hardly no one is here. It gives me time to interact with the bartenders and waiters and waitresses. Delicious margaritas, queso,tacos,ad omg dis I say margaritas? There's a good selection of different margarita creations that you must try!!! Again this place can become crowded real fast. There's pay parking and if you lucky street free parking. The brisket tacos is my favorite and the Cadillac Margarita is a good one to try!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"4E6kHJ7yxDpu43L8he6F7A","photo_id":"qbeNjy70usqZukEZrSgcvg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/qbeNjy70usqZukEZrSgcvg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9099776744842529},{"business_id":"4E6kHJ7yxDpu43L8he6F7A","photo_id":"TdKw7FZCcZ3aSnxEpVm-ow","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/TdKw7FZCcZ3aSnxEpVm-ow.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9001955986022949},{"business_id":"4E6kHJ7yxDpu43L8he6F7A","photo_id":"nhDVyoJfj0-iY1_dYKwY_Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/nhDVyoJfj0-iY1_dYKwY_Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8782106041908264},{"business_id":"4E6kHJ7yxDpu43L8he6F7A","photo_id":"rpnHnLxxS_tFPwzftqOJBw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/rpnHnLxxS_tFPwzftqOJBw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8672564625740051}]},"notebook_case":null}
